БГ - ФЕОДАЛИЗМ
- </span><span style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";text-transform:
uppercase'>ангел<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:red;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:red;layout-grid-mode:line'>АНГЕЛ</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><i><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Б.
Гребенщиков<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>Вступление:
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'> - 2</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>p</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">               
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                   
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'> </span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>Я
связан с ней
цепью, цепью
неизвестной
длины.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>C<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            
</span><span class="SpellE">Am</span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            
</span>F<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">               
</span>Em<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      
</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>Мы
спим в одной
постели по
разные
стороны
стены.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>C<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">          
</span>G<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                
</span>C<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>/</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>h</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black'> </span><span class="SpellE"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Am</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span>F<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>И
всё
замечательно
ясно, но что в
том небесам?<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>F<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                     
</span>Em<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">             
</span>F<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       
</span>G<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span>C<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>И
каждый умрёт
только той
смертью, которую
найдёт себе
сам.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>Проигрыш:
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'> - 2</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>p</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>У неё
свои демоны,
и свои
соловьи за
спиной,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>И каждый
из них был
причиной, по
которой она
не со мной.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>Но под
медленным
взглядом
икон в
сердце, сыром
от дождя,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>Я понял,
что я
невиновен, а
значит, что я
не судья.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>Проигрыш:
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'> - 2</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>p</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>Так
сделай мне
ангела, и я
покажу тебе
твердь.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>Покажи
мне
счастливых
людей, и я
покажу тебе
смерть.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>Поведай
мне чудо
побега из
этой тюрьмы,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>И я скажу,
что того, что
есть у нас,
хватило бы <span class="GramE">для</span>
больших, чем
мы.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>Проигрыш:
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'> - 2</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>p</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>Я связан
с ней цепью,
цепью
неизвестной
длины,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>Я связан
с ней
церковью,
церковью
любви и войны.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>А небо
становится
ближе, так
близко, что
больно
глазам;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>И в итоге
каждый умрёт
той смертью,
которую придумает
сам.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>Заключение:
C <span class="SpellE">Am</span> - 2p. C</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<table class="MsoTableGrid" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;mso-yfti-tbllook:480;mso-padding-alt:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt">
<tr style="mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes">
<td valign="top" style="padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt">
<p class="MsoNormal"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">           
  </span>C<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
